<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 1100s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 12th century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 1100s, 775 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 296 were founded and 150 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Abbasid Caliphate, the Jin dynasty (1115-1234) and the Byzantine Empire.</p></header>
